<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken adds 50 mln DKK to 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken adds 50 mln DKK to 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken has increased an existing four percent 2005 bond by 50 million crowns, to a total of 550 million, arranger Gume Raaschou said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It added that all the bonds were sold. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
